{title: 565 - For the Beauty of the Earth}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #565 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 565}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]For [D7]the [D]beau[G]ty [C]of [D7]the [G]earth,
[C]For [D7]the [G]glo[C]ry [G]of [D]the [G]skies,
[G]For [D7]the [D]love [G]which [C]from [D7]our [G]birth
[C]O[D7]ver [G]and [C]a[G]round [D]us [G]lies;
[G]Lord [D]of [G]all, to [D]Thee we [G]raise
[C]This [D7]our [G]grate[C]ful [G]song [D7]of [G]praise.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G][D7]For [D]the [G]joy [C]of [D7]human [G]love,
[C][D7]brother, [G][C]sister, [G][D]parent, [G]child,
[G][D7]friends [D]on [G]earth [C]and [D7]friends [G]above,
[C][D7]Pleasures [G][C]pure [G][D]and [G]undefiled,
[G]Lord [D]of [G]all, to [D]Thee [G]we raise
[C][D7]this [G]our [C]grateful [G]song [D7]of [G]praise.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[G]For [D7]the [D]gift [G]of [C]Thy [D7]dear [G]Son,
[C]for [D7]the [G]hope [C]of [G]heaven [D]at [G]last,
[G][D7]for [D]the [G][C]Spirit's [D7]victory [G]won,
[C]For [D7]the [G]crown [C]when [G]life [D]is [G]past,
[G]Lord [D]of [G]all, to [D]Thee [G]we raise
[C][D7]Songs [G]of [C][G]gratitude [D7]and [G]praise.
{end_of_verse}
